+RWDN_01=Threat &amp; geo firewall
+RWDN_02=Warden blocks traffic to and from known-malicious IP ranges (curated threat feeds), whole countries, and IPs you list by hand &mdash; enforced with kernel ipset for near-zero overhead. Your LAN, live connections, and whitelist are <b>always</b> exempt so it can never lock you out.
