+RWDN_26=Countries blocked
+RWDN_27=Update feeds now
+RWDN_28=Save &amp; Apply
+RWDN_29=Never
+RWDN_30=Applying Warden rules&hellip;
+RWDN_31=FireHOL Level 1
+RWDN_32=Feodo Tracker (botnet C2)
+RWDN_33=Spamhaus DROP
+RWDN_34=DShield top attackers
+RWDN_35=e.g. RU, CN, KP
+RWDN_36=203.0.113.7&#10;198.51.100.0/24
+RWDN_37=192.0.2.0/24
+RWDN_38=How Warden works
+RWDN_39=Blocks are enforced with ipset hash:net matched in iptables INPUT and FORWARD &mdash; one set lookup regardless of list size.
+RWDN_40=Feeds and country lists refresh on a schedule and are cached to /jffs; a booted router with no internet still enforces the last download.
+RWDN_41=Your LAN subnet, ESTABLISHED/RELATED connections, and the whitelist are matched first and always exempt.
